ASK { gmeow:isFalse a owl:DatatypeProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:isFalse MUST NOT be declared an owl:DatatypeProperty -- a falsehood is a refuted StandpointClaim modality, never a boolean flag (Principles 1, 12; no-isFalse doctrine)." .

