ASK { gmeow:isDeceptive a owl:ObjectProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:isDeceptive MUST NOT be declared an owl:ObjectProperty -- deceptiveness is a defeasible attributed claim that coexists with its denial, never an entailed flag (Principle 9; no-isFalse doctrine)." .

