ASK { gmeow:isDeceptive a owl:DatatypeProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:isDeceptive MUST NOT be declared an owl:DatatypeProperty -- deceptiveness is a defeasible attributed claim, never a boolean data flag (Principle 9; no-isFalse doctrine)." .

# --- 16. No isDeceptive property declared as AnnotationProperty (MUST-NOT) ---
ex:saNoIsDeceptiveAnnotationProperty a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
ASK { gmeow:isDeceptive a owl:AnnotationProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:isDeceptive MUST NOT be declared an owl:AnnotationProperty -- deceptiveness is a defeasible attributed claim, never an annotation flag (Principle 9; no-isFalse doctrine)." .

# --- 17. veridicalityLicensedFalsehood is NOT a subclass of veridicalityUntrue
#        (MUST-NOT) ------------------------------------------------------------
ex:saLicensedFalsehoodNotSubclassUntrue a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK { gmeow:veridicalityLicensedFalsehood rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:veridicalityUntrue . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:veridicalityLicensedFalsehood MUST NOT be rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:veridicalityUntrue -- licensed falsehood and untrue are siblings, neither subsumes the other; fiction is not deception (licensed-falsehood safety property)." .

# --- 18. veridicalityUntrue is NOT a subclass of veridicalityLicensedFalsehood
#        (MUST-NOT) ------------------------------------------------------------
ex:saUntrueNotSubclassLicensedFalsehood a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK { gmeow:veridicalityUntrue rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:veridicalityLicensedFalsehood . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:veridicalityUntrue MUST NOT be rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:veridicalityLicensedFalsehood -- the two veridicality siblings are co-equal; deception is not a special case of fiction (licensed-falsehood safety property)." .

